    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d406">

                <pb facs="0597" n="583" xml:id="pg583"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BC Indonesia/12–1749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        United States Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Austin</hi>)<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d406-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-12-19T13:00:00-05:00">December 19,
                            1949—1 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>644, Reurtel No. 1443, Dec 17,<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d406-f2"/> please advise Palar orally that the US Govt appreciates
                    invitation send delegation attend celebration transfer of sovereignty to Repub
                    of US of Indonesia, and accepts invitation, designating Mr. Jacob Beam, US
                        ConGen, Batavia, as Rep of U.S. Govt. All arrangements re US
                    Representation and transportation of Reps will
                    be made thru office of US GonGen, Batavia.</p>
                <p>Please confirm orally Mr. Cochran’s appreciation and acceptance of invitation to
                    be present ceremonies, explaining that Mr. Cochran will attend as U.S. Rep
                    UNCFI. Mr. Cochran leaving NY Dec 21 by plane
                    for Batavia.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d406-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d406-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated as 632 to Batavia.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d406-f2" n="2" xml:id="d406-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed; it gave the text of the Indonesian invitation to attend ceremonies
                    at Jakarta (Batavia), December 27–28.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
